<title>AUSTRIA: SOCCER-AUSTRIA AND LATVIA DRAW 0-0 IN UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AUSTRIA AND LATVIA DRAW 0-0 IN UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>GLOGGNITZ, Austria 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria and Latvia drew 0-0 in a European under-21 soccer championship group four qualifier on Saturday.</p>
<p>Attendance: 1,000.</p>
</text>
